sinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824790/extras/b62b2cefec960496d1eba608917364be.poster.avif?t=1755264123\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824790/extras/b62b2cefec960496d1eba608917364be.webm?t=1755264123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824790/extras/b62b2cefec960496d1eba608917364be.mp4?t=1755264123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824790/extras/94e98fa03070afb5dcd3688167e51814.avif?t=1755264123\" width=800 height=27 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a card game. It\u2019s not your standard autobattler. It\u2019s not a serious roguelike. GUG is GUG: a creature collector where the gugs are ludicrous, the logic is real, and your new arch-nemesis might be \u201cMildly Upset Pigeon\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824790/extras/eb0e8cf6a19e9920941fe66d44c8fe7c.poster.avif?t=1755264123\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824790/extras/eb0e8cf6a19e9920941fe66d44c8fe7c.webm?t=1755264123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824790/extras/eb0e8cf6a19e9920941fe66d44c8fe7c.mp4?t=1755264123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
